WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.416 --> 00:00:03.706
Unit eleven. Understanding Firewalls!

2
00:00:04.668 --> 00:00:09.763
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Daniel, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.813 --> 00:00:13.188
Hi, Mr. Daniel! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.238 --> 00:00:17.526
Today we learn about Understanding Firewalls. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.615 --> 00:00:22.248
Firewall. Say it with me. Firewall!

6
00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:31.329
Network security. Say it with me. Network security!

7
00:00:34.828 --> 00:00:39.053
Block traffic. Say it with me. Block traffic!

8
00:00:42.517 --> 00:00:45.918
Filter. Say it with me. Filter!

9
00:00:49.453 --> 00:00:54.003
Protect device. Say it with me. Protect device!

10
00:00:57.468 --> 00:01:01.090
Barrier. Say it with me. Barrier!

11
00:01:04.665 --> 00:01:10.063
Unauthorized access. Say it with me. Unauthorized access!

12
00:01:13.548 --> 00:01:18.162
Security layer. Say it with me. Security layer!

13
00:01:21.651 --> 00:01:31.049
A firewall is a security layer that filters network traffic, blocking unauthorized access. It acts as a barrier to protect a device or network.

14
00:01:31.099 --> 00:01:34.696
Now I understand. Thank you, Mr. Daniel!

15
00:01:35.778 --> 00:01:41.306
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:41.356 --> 00:01:42.910
Block traffic!

17
00:01:44.013 --> 00:01:49.171
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.221 --> 00:01:50.993
Unauthorized access!

19
00:01:52.183 --> 00:01:59.335
Did you know? The term 'firewall' comes from a real physical wall designed to stop a fire from spreading between buildings!

20
00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:01.434
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:02.708 --> 00:02:12.056
Think and answer. Why might a firewall be an important part of network security?

22
00:02:12.106 --> 00:02:13.256
Great answer!

23
00:02:14.169 --> 00:02:19.324
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:19.374 --> 00:02:22.425
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

